{"hw":"ἀπαναισχυντέω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀπαναισχυντέω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀπαναισχυντέω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">behave with effrontery,</b> c. acc. cogn., <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. τοῦτο</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">31b</span> </span>; c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Alex.Aphr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">in Top.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">524.5</span> </span>: abs., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">29.20</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">54.33</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">put away shame,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hld.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.5</span> </span>.</div></div>"}